{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>The fifth time</b><br>רשפיה. Like ולחומי רשף גחליה (and its coals were flames of reshef)." "שלהבת. The shin [is] in place of אשר, and the lamed is at rest, and there is none like it in Scripture." "<b>The second time</b><br>And now: set me [upon your heart] as a seal upon your hand and upon your arm as a seal." "<b>The third time</b><br>And afterwards Knesset Israel says to the Shekhinah: set me as a seal upon your heart. The meaning is that she will never turn away from after the Shekhinah."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:02.904342390Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}